# What’s to come

That’s a wrap for July. Next month, we will have more database updates, including good news for developers working with SQL, and some very big news!

Stay tuned!

Follow us on [X](https://x.com/aacsearch) and check our [Changelog](https://aacsearch.io/changelog) regularly, as we will release more information in the coming weeks.
